            </div>
        </article>

        <article class="video-card" data-category="install" onclick="openVideoModal('Brake Install Guide', 'Step-by-step walkthrough for installing Ultra Bee brakes on your Surron.', '/images/back%20with%20stuff.png')">
            <div class="video-thumbnail">
