            </div>
            <div class="video-info">
                <span class="video-category">Lifestyle</span>
                <h3>Riding in Paradise: Hawaii Edition</h3>
                <p>Join us for a tropical ride through the best Hawaii has to offer.</p>
                <div class="video-meta">
                    <span>25K views</span>
                    <span>1 week ago</span>
